T*
(STD-PHA-001 PAGE 4 OF 5 - UNIT 2300 AUTHORITATIVE HAZOP WORKSHEET REGISTER) Tj
T*
(Node 2300-01: Preflash Column V-2301 & Vacuum Package X-2301) Tj
T*
(- Deviation: High Temperature / Loss of Vacuum \(> 105 degC in V-2301 sump containing 82 wt% CHP\)) Tj
T*
(- Unmitigated Consequence: Thermal auto-decomposition of 82 wt% CHP \(SADT 75 degC\), rapid pressure rise \(Severity 5, Likelihood C -> Tier 1 Extreme Risk\).) Tj
T*
(- Independent Protection Layers \(IPLs\):) Tj
T*
(  1. Interlock I-2301 \(SIL-2\): TAHH-0402 >= 105 degC or PAHH-0401 >= 75 mmHgA trips reboiler steam XV-0403 and injects emergency cumene flush XV-0409.) Tj
T*
(  2. Mechanical Relief: PSV-2301 \(Set 3.5 kg/cm2g, Orifice 3K4\) relieves to Knock-Out Drum D-2320.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Node 2300-02: Decomposer Reactor D-2304 & Circulation Cooler E-2307) Tj
T*
(- Deviation: High Temperature \(> 115 degC\) / Loss of E-2307 Cooling or Excess Acid Catalyst) Tj
T*
(- Unmitigated Consequence: Exponential exothermic CHP cleavage runaway \(-1580 kJ/kg\), two-phase overpressure exceeding vessel MAWP \(Severity 5, Likelihood C -> Tier 1 Extreme Risk\).) Tj
T*
(- Independent Protection Layers \(IPLs\):) Tj
T*
(  1. BPCS Temperature Control Loop TIC-1302 modulating E-2307 cooling water valve TV-1302 \(Fails Open FO\) + High Alarm TAH-1301 at 92.0 degC.) Tj
T*
(  2. SIS Interlock I-2304 \(SIL-2, PFDavg = 0.004\): 2oo3 Voting TXSHH-1301 >= 115.0 degC or PAHH-1301 >= 5.5 kg/cm2g or FSLL-1304 <= 110,000 kg/hr trips acid feed valve XV-1305, stops CHP pump P-2301A/B, and opens Emergency Cumene Quench Valve XV-1309 \(Stream S387\).) Tj
T*
(  3. Mechanical Overpressure Protection: Dual Balanced-Bellows Relief Valves PSV-2304A/B \(Set 11.0 kg/cm2g, Orifice 4J6\) discharging to Knock-Out Drum D-2320.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
